repository-code: "https://github.com/delschlangen/ai-governance-controls"
url: "https://delschlangen.github.io/ai-governance-controls"
abstract: >-
  A practical toolkit for operationalizing AI governance frameworks
  (NIST AI RMF, EU AI Act) into machine-readable, auditable control
  catalogs with automated compliance evaluation. Includes 15 governance
  controls mapped to regulatory requirements, severity-weighted scoring,
  EU AI Act risk tier classification, and actionable remediation guidance.
